as written: the logical plan
  ORDER_BY  revenue, largest first
    PROJECTION
      AGGREGATE  one row per segment
        FILTER  order_date in December
          COMPARISON_JOIN  inner, on account_key
            SEQ_SCAN  fct_order_lines: 18 of 18 columns
            SEQ_SCAN  dim_account: 14 of 14 columns
as it will run: the physical plan, projections not shown
  ORDER_BY  revenue, largest first
    HASH_GROUP_BY  one row per segment
      HASH_JOIN  inner, on account_key
        SEQ_SCAN  fct_order_lines: 2 of 18 columns, filtered
        SEQ_SCAN  dim_account: 2 of 14 columns
pushed into the scans, and the planner's estimates:
  fct_order_lines: account_key, revenue
    where order_date>='2025-12-01' AND order_date<'2026-01-01'
    expects 245,812 of 1,229,062 rows
  dim_account: account_key, segment
    expects 11,340 of 11,340 rows
